            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose gway báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aroni nee na/iiwós nee xoorór Israeliwo ka beeto, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gár naa hara'ayín a tí: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé xoorór Israeli barnaxés i awuú gaasár wa slaa', laqaá deelmoó bee/i, laqaá leei, baraá xaftá wa ale laqaá tsee/aá xafi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitángw ngiwa huwi dír afkú heémár Mungú didá' hhoohhoo' as ngiwa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i haniisi, heedaádá' i dakuúsár kón ar tseere ngiwa ku'uús, nee inós kun baynitis dír xooroorós ar Israeliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara'ayaarí kana qaás as kahhó' xoorór Israeli hikwaaín kudá' geera ta tsu/i baraá aykú wa ale, ngiwa huwiya' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, dír geeraá kaahamusmoó Mungú, nee dír afkú heémár Mungú, inós giri tsuu/, giri ilahhooár waydú wa haniis dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy kaahamusmoó Mungú tseere gari hikimiis gawaá kitángw ilahhooa oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuduú geeraá heémár Mungú i dirií', nee wahhnár hikwaadá' gari daa/ as tawa slaahhareeraá tsuuá' awa AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngu sla'atimiisá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe xoorór Israeli munguidaá lama awa slaqás nee slee ilahhooárií tsu/taaro ngi maye', asma gaarí an gár inkihhimu ngusa dakuusiye' dir'eene. Dakwí i hotaatín ay alhhe'eesay wasle, nee oo ta eehari ay qari sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Inooín ki beer, heé xoorór Israeli, laqaá hoomoó baraá tla/angw'ín wa hoót oo ilahhooár da/tá hanimiís, laqaá tam ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala ngwa huwiiká dír geeraá heémár Mungú as nguwa gaasi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, heewí aqo kun baynitis dír mukós oo Israeliro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hee tam gaalá oo xoorór Israeli, laqaá hoomoó ayaaín wa hoót, oo tseere gaa /ayi, heedaádá' aníng u alkoóm nee nguri baynitís dír mukose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma slafíngw umuú gaaro i baraá tseere. Hara'aya ngina haniís as tseere ngiwa huba' dír kitángw ilahhooa, as haraki/isa kawa tleehhi as kuungá'. Asma tseere i haraki/isár tlehhít, asma slafiingw i baraá tseere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An gár aníng hara'aya ngisa oó' dír xoorór Israeli, nee hoomár ayaaín hoota, as tseere makawa baloó /aáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heé xoorór Israeli laqaá hoomoó ayaaín wa hoót bira makiito'ór slaktuú áy, laqaá tsir/i, a gár hariim tseere ngiwa yaamií ku'uusi, gari hhapeérár tiip. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma slafíngw umuú gaaro i baraá tseere, an gár xoorór Israeli ngisa báw, ‹Tseerér umuú makiito'ooro ka waak /aymaaro, asma slafíngw umuú gaaro i baraá tseere.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heé yaamuloousmo laqaá hoomo oo gár aa kilós gwa' gaa /aay, laqaá ar taa gaás nee makiito'ór sla/a, gár kuwa hariím tlabaawós gin hhuunts, nee iri hamtlín, inós iri dah baraá meeta ay tsiindo. Aluuwo iri hhoohhooúy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala bar tlabaawós gaa hhuuntsiiká nee aa hamtlinká, heewí tlakweemaawós i daanduuwós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
